<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Test Infrastructure on Onur Celep</title><link>https://onurcelep.github.io/tags/test-infrastructure/</link><description>Recent content in Test Infrastructure on Onur Celep</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 09 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://onurcelep.github.io/tags/test-infrastructure/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>About</title><link>https://onurcelep.github.io/about/</link><pubDate>Fri, 09 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://onurcelep.github.io/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I am a staff-level software engineer based in Berlin. Since 2013 I have built developer platforms, CI/CD systems, and test infrastructure for products at Mercedes-Benz, Intel, Ericsson, and trivago.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;My focus is the tooling that lets engineering organizations ship reliably: build and test pipelines, hardware-in-the-loop labs, and agent tooling that fits safely alongside them.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="experience"&gt;&#10; Experience&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#experience"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;dl&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.linutronix.de/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Linutronix (Intel)&lt;/a&gt;, since 2024&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Lead, freelance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://mbition.io/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Mbition (Mercedes-Benz)&lt;/a&gt;, 2022 - 2023&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://mbition.io/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Mbition (Mercedes-Benz)&lt;/a&gt;, 2020 - 2022&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (DevOps)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.luxoft.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Luxoft&lt;/a&gt;, 2018 - 2020&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QA Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.trivago.com/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;trivago&lt;/a&gt;, 2017 - 2018&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Developer in Test&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ericsson.com/en" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Ericsson&lt;/a&gt;, 2013 - 2017&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;/dl&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="open-source"&gt;&#10; Open Source&#10; &lt;a class="heading-link" href="#open-source"&gt;&#10; &lt;i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true" title="Link to heading"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#10; &lt;span class="sr-only"&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;dl&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/onurcelep/labgrid-mcp" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;labgrid-mcp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;MCP server for hardware-in-the-loop device control.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/onurcelep/ai-factory" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;ai-factory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;Agent-ready repository setup for Claude Code.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;dt&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/onurcelep/picokvm-client" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;picokvm-client&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/dt&gt;&#10;&lt;dd&gt;Python client for the Luckfox PicoKVM.&lt;/dd&gt;&#10;&lt;/dl&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="tools"&